    '46#_': `In Shulchan Aruch seif 46 garment, etc., and not before us to ask, etc. Shach s.k. 61 wrote not before us, etc., appears garment also not before us — if she before us let her check if congealed or coagulated; one not expert should forbid, etc.; not place here for Israelite and not before us we consider certainly tamei for chazakah was laundered — on this we do not rely on congealing and coagulating at all; Shach's words refer if Israelite before us and said did not check or non-Jew even before us like not before us; implies from Shulchan Aruch tehorah; Shach says meaning garment lost and impossible to check — otherwise forbidden — plain; so Torat HaBayit explicitly — see there. But precision required — deals she wore after laundering before checking — otherwise how think to attribute to before laundering; thus R. Chananel's view all the more Ramban and Tosafot whoever takes from hidden place without prior check until unexamined ed and Rashba declares tehorah even in examination all the more stain — how declare tamei here unknown if congealed or coagulated; must say above deals hidden place meaning hand of all did not use but nevertheless not sealed in box until no doubt stain perhaps from elsewhere fell on it — therefore Rashba holds since never had chazakah of examined attribute from elsewhere not from woman; unlike here deals immediately garment from launderer sealed in box until impossible stain fall on it — certainly from woman only doubt perhaps was before laundering — well attributes to congealed or coagulated — correct.`,
